{"id":"8e6d25636bb24474","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-value.md","title":"Value","display":"df-value — Value","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-value","aliases":["58-df-value"],"display":"df-value — Value","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-value"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-value</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-value — Value"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,x,y,A,B\\in V\">\\(f,x,y,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Value}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Value}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}value} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Value}_S(f,x,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in A\\land y\\in B\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}value} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Value}_S(f,x,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in A\\land y\\in B\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A function value is the unique second coordinate paired with the argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,x,y,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Value}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}value} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Value}_S(f,x,y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists A,B\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\land x\\in A\\land y\\in B\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f)","display":true}],"bytes":637,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-value.md|58-df-value]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}